{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/amplitudeencoding\/amplitudebatchencoder"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AmplitudeEncoding\/documentation\/AmplitudeEncoding"]]},"metadata":{"title":"AmplitudeBatchEncoder","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/AmplitudeEncoding\/AmplitudeBatchEncoder.swift#L74","fileName":"AmplitudeBatchEncoder.swift"},"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"AmplitudeEncoding"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:17AmplitudeEncoding0A12BatchEncoderV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AmplitudeBatchEncoder"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AmplitudeBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AmplitudeBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Make the destination with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AmplitudeEncoding\/documentation\/AmplitudeEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/amplitude(apiKey:region:plan:backoff:clock:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which fills in the endpoint, this encoder and Amplitude’s limits:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let amplitude = try HTTPDestination.amplitude(","    apiKey: apiKey,","    region: .eu,  \/\/ or .us, where the project's data resides","    plan: plan)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The body is a JSON object of content type ","type":"text"},{"code":"application\/json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with two members: ","type":"text"},{"code":"api_key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"project’s API key, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"events","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", one object per record, oldest first, with these members:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Member","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Holds","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device_id"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s session, its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionKey"},{"type":"text","text":", as a lowercase UUID string; the record’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventRecord\/id"},{"type":"text","text":" when its context has no session"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event_properties"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The event’s stored properties, by name","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event_type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event\/name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as it is","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"insert_id"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventRecord\/id"},{"type":"text","text":", as a lowercase UUID string; a redelivered record keeps it"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"session_id","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The session’s start in Unix milliseconds, the first 48 bits of its version 7 ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; left out for a record with no session, or a session key of another version","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"time","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the event was tracked, in whole milliseconds since 1970"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The session is the only identifier sent: there is no ","type":"text"},{"code":"user_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and no ","type":"text"},{"code":"ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"idfv","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"device identifier. Amplitude counts a user per ","type":"text"},{"code":"device_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so its unique users are sessions. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record with no session (one tracked by a tracker without ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or one a store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recovered after a relaunch, which keeps no context) is its own anonymous user, linked to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing: Amplitude rejects an event with neither a ","type":"text"},{"code":"device_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" nor a ","type":"text"},{"code":"user_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Amplitude drops","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a second copy of an event with the same ","type":"text"},{"code":"insert_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"device_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so a recovered record that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Amplitude had already stored under its session, before the app ended, is stored again. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record’s vendor identifier and trace context, and any other context value, aren’t sent. Nor is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ","type":"text"},{"code":"ip","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": neither an address nor ","type":"text"},{"code":"$remote","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which asks Amplitude to look the user’s location up","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the request’s address.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"code":"PropertyReader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads them. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","type":"reference"},{"text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out, an element of an array is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and one inside a type the plan can’t map is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Amplitude limits each string value to 1,024 characters; the encoder sends longer ones as they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each event also holds these members, for each of the keys the record’s context has a value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Member"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Holds"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"app_version","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ApplicationKey","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The version, left out when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device_model"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph",